      "uid": "zhcn:0eff39097c0e29a98704ed5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……嗯。再跑一会吧。跑多少次都行……\r\n不断奔跑、不断奔跑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c31241cab48ad1619c5a4a765b24e041e8103e9c0318cdf08f47ab4b4253b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
