    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84c24fc8021d19baffe2c61c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她奔跑的模样，宛如要融入夜色那般的轻柔而缓和——\r\n但是在终点前，她却展现出了惊人的爆发力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be8148b2edbd362b4c2547c202cb7cb01ca42fd5f5a31e4a80334c947f91548c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
